<title>TUNISIA: SOCCER-TUNISIA BEAT SIERRA LEONE 2-0 IN AFRICA CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TUNISIA BEAT SIERRA LEONE 2-0 IN AFRICA CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia beat Sierra Leone 2-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in an African Nations Cup group four soccer</p>
<p>qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Sami Trabelsi (29th minute), Skander Soyah (69th</p>
<p>minute).</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
